-     /** @brief Erases log entries of the specified type
-      *
-      *  This function deletes log entries corresponding to the given log type.
-      *  If an entry ID is provided, it erases only that specific entry; otherwise,
-      *  it erases all entries of the given log type.
-      *
-      *  @param[in] logTypeStr - Log type as a string (e.g., "ipmi", "raid", "default")
